   "race": "Windshaper Skyborne",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "So you think you are good enough to learn from me? The great Snarl? You are no more than a lowly worm beneath my boot. However, taking on an underling might make me seem more appealing to Sumi and Tumi. Let's see what meager skills you possess.",
